# Link against whatever BLAS/LAPACK R itself is configured with (reference by
# default, or OpenBLAS/MKL if the user swapped R's Rblas/Rlapack). This is the
# standard, maximally portable setup -- no external dependencies, builds on any
# R version. For faster linear algebra, point R at an optimized BLAS globally
# (see README); every package, this one included, then benefits automatically.
PKG_LIBS = $(LAPACK_LIBS) $(BLAS_LIBS) $(FLIBS)
